# Copy to `.dev.vars` for local dev. In production these are secrets:
#   npx wrangler secret put MODEL_API_KEY
#
# .dev.vars is gitignored. Never commit real keys.

# ---- Model provider -------------------------------------------------------
# Leave MODEL_PROVIDER as "mock" (set in wrangler.jsonc) until you pick one.
# Then set MODEL_PROVIDER in wrangler.jsonc and the key here.
MODEL_API_KEY=""

# ---- Web search (optional) ------------------------------------------------
# Set SEARCH_PROVIDER in wrangler.jsonc to brave | tavily | exa, then:
SEARCH_API_KEY=""

# ---- X / Twitter (optional) -----------------------------------------------
# Without this the agent still reads public posts via oEmbed, just with less
# metadata (no author stats, no thread context).
X_BEARER_TOKEN=""

# ---- Video transcripts (needed in production) -----------------------------
# YouTube answers Cloudflare's egress with "Sign in to confirm you're not a bot",
# so the built-in reader gets captions in local dev and nothing once deployed.
# Set TRANSCRIPT_PROVIDER in wrangler.jsonc (or in Settings) to "supadata", then:
TRANSCRIPT_API_KEY=""

# ---- Access control (optional but recommended once deployed) --------------
# If set, the UI asks for this passphrase before it will talk to the API.
APP_PASSWORD=""
